#: site:site.dataRights.erasure.body
msgid "site.dataRights.erasure.body"
msgstr "Someone with owner access asked for the data of your workspace to be erased. Nothing has been removed yet, and the workspace keeps working until the date below."

#: site:site.dataRights.erasure.detail
msgid "site.dataRights.erasure.detail"
msgstr "The erasure will run on {date}."

#: site:site.dataRights.erasure.note
msgid "site.dataRights.erasure.note"
msgstr "If this was not intended, open Settings in your workspace and take the request back. Records we must keep by law — issued invoices, the accounting entries behind them, the payments they rest on and the record of consents given — are not removed by an erasure; that screen lists each of them."

#: site:site.dataRights.erasure.subject
msgid "site.dataRights.erasure.subject"
msgstr "Zabuno — an erasure was requested for your workspace"

